this is  no longer a city of one and a half  million people many have fled  the russians are raising whole  residential districts to the ground  they say civilians are being used as  human shields and that soldiers are  hiding among them  but how can they tell from up there as  the bombs continue to  indiscriminately  [Music]  the battle for kiev continues too with  daily shelling that includes residential  buildings from russian positions just 15  kilometers away  and closer quarters fighting on its  suburban outskirts  western intelligence assessments point  to a ground offensive that has largely  stalled with russian troops making  little or no  progress but if towns like urpin butcher  and ostomel were to form a path could  open up for a push on the capital  and russia maintains its stranglehold on  mariopol the southern port city another  important strategic objective  a convoy of civilian vehicles reportedly  two thousand of them left via a  humanitarian corridor that held for a  second day  but still no aid supplies made it in  and still hundreds of thousands exist in  conditions of unimaginable hardship  bodies are said to lie uncollected in  the street supplies of food water and  medicine near exhausted  easing the flight of mario paul was a  key demand of the ukrainian side in  ceasefire talks that continued on  tuesday but there is a lot more still to  do  on behalf of the ukrainian people we  give you a chance to live if you  surrender to our forces we will treat  you as humans have to be treated with  dignity the way you have not been  treated by your own army and the way  your army does not treat our people  choose so a second day of cease-fire  talks and separately an advisor to  president zelinski has said he believes  the war will be over by may at the very  latest a prediction based on  intelligence reports of slower than  expected russian progress larger than  expected russian losses its forces  spread increasingly thinly across the  vastness of north south and eastern  ukraine  wishful thinking perhaps  the units of the people's militia of the  donets republic continued to compress  the encirclement in mariopol the general  advance from the east the northern and  western direction was up to 800 meters  the divisions of the russian armed  forces are continuing offence of  operations  there are reports that russia has  already prevailed on allies like china  and syria for help  but all the heart in this fight belongs  to ukraine and it refuses to submit  joe nahul al jazeera will leave

